# Normalize all text files to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, the Windows CI runner (core.autocrlf=true by default) checks out
# the conformance fixtures with CRLF line endings. The fixture parsers in
# ConformanceTests / IdnaTestV2Tests trim only `.whitespaces` (not `\r`) and
# slice by fixed offsets, so a trailing `\r` makes every row fail to parse and
# the suites load zero cases. Pinning eol=lf keeps the checkout identical to the
# LF-only blobs stored in the index.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Precompiled blobs are binary: never apply line-ending or text filters to them.
*.bin binary
